{"task_id": "HumanEval/36", "solution": "def fizz_buzz(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return the number of times the digit 7 appears in integers less than n which are divisible by 11 or 13.\n    >>> fizz_buzz(50)\n    0\n    >>> fizz_buzz(78)\n    2\n    >>> fizz_buzz(79)\n    3\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _is_divisible_by(number: int, divisor: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is divisible by a given divisor.\"\"\"\n        return number % divisor == 0\n\n    def _count_digit_in_number(number: int, digit: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Counts occurrences of a specific digit in a number.\"\"\"\n        count = 0\n        num_str = str(number)\n        digit_str = str(digit)\n        for char in num_str:\n            if char == digit_str:\n                count += 1\n        return count\n\n    total_sevens_count = 0\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        if _is_divisible_by(i, 11) or _is_divisible_by(i, 13):\n            total_sevens_count += _count_digit_in_number(i, 7)\n    return total_sevens_count"}
